    {
      "id": "survey-hanu-et-al-2017",
      "subject": "Resolved-model surveys: body-specific candidate not established",
      "status": "unresolved",
      "finding": "The imported survey cites Hanuš 2017, Viikinkoski 2017 and Vernazza 2021 without identifying a selected product for this body. The current DAMIT reference join does not bind selected model 5792 to those surveys. This does not prove that no resolved model exists elsewhere; a body-specific candidate and its release must be identified before the entry can count as included.",
      "revisitWhen": "A target row, supplementary model or release URL from one of these surveys establishes a concrete candidate and permits comparison with the selected shape.",
